  "descriptionMarkdown": "This small fort makes everything you need early game, up to red research. It provides the player with all the items needed to hand craft the things needed to kickstart a bus with smelters and production of more items.\n\n**Makes the following items:**\n\n* Red Science \n* Iron Gear \n* Green Circuit\n* Ammo \n* Belt \n* Steel (for a steel axe and a heavy armor)\n* Stone Brick and Wall \n\n**Other features:**\n\n* Trash chest (for pistol, coal miners and other unwanted items)\n* Surrounded by a wall with only 1 structure touching the wall\n* Quad Turret defense\n* Lights for at extra vision at night\n* Can be upgraded with a few fast inserters and assembling machine 2's if wanted.\n\n**To feed this once I upgraded to fast inserters and assembly machine 2's I used 24 iron smelters, 6 copper smelters and 4 stone miners. The smelters were all fed through direct feeding.**\n",
